Package: brightness-control
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sarthak <sarthakkumar766@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libxapp1, ddcutil
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Brightness slider for an external monitor, in the panel
 Laptop brightness keys do not reach a monitor plugged in over HDMI or
 DisplayPort. This adds a sun icon to the panel: click it for a brightness
 slider, or scroll on it to go up and down in steps.
 .
 The monitor is controlled over DDC/CI using ddcutil. The icon appears as soon
 as the package is installed and starts by itself at every login.
